{"id":"04bd0d627c2b2877","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness.md","title":"ZFC CI Tower Number Witness","display":"df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness — ZFC CI Tower Number Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness — ZFC CI Tower Number Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness — ZFC CI Tower Number Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,X,e,\\lambda,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T,X,e,\\lambda,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}tower\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal T) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal T\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\mathcal T\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists\\lambda,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\lambda,\\mathcal T)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=\\mathcal T\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(e(\\alpha)=e(\\beta)\\to\\alpha=\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to|e(\\beta)\\setminus e(\\alpha)|&lt;\\omega)\\Bigr)\\land \\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal T\\;(|X\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}tower\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal T) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal T\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\mathcal T\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists\\lambda,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\lambda,\\mathcal T)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=\\mathcal T\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(e(\\alpha)=e(\\beta)\\to\\alpha=\\beta)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to|e(\\beta)\\setminus e(\\alpha)|&lt;\\omega)\\Bigr)\\land \\neg\\exists X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal T\\;(|X\\setminus A|&lt;\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A tower is explicitly well ordered by reverse almost inclusion; an arbitrary mod-finite linear chain is not by itself a tower witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetA